@startuml system-architecture
!theme plain
top to bottom direction
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title SCENTSTATION - KIẾN TRÚC MICROSERVICE HIỆN TẠI VÀ ĐIỂM MỞ RỘNG

actor "API consumer\nFrontend/Kiosk tương lai" as Client
actor "Payment Provider" as Provider

package "Edge" {
  component "API Gateway :8080\nTrust Boundary Filter" as Gateway
}

package "Database-per-service bounded contexts" {
  component "Identity :8081\nDB: scentstation_identity" as Identity
  component "Catalog :8082\nDB: scentstation_catalog" as Catalog
  component "Order :8083\nDB: order_db" as Order
  component "Machine :8084\nDB: scentstation_machine" as Machine
  component "Operation :8085\nDB: scentstation_operation" as Operation
  component "Reporting :8086\nDB: scentstation_reporting" as Reporting

  Identity -[hidden]right- Catalog
  Catalog -[hidden]right- Order
  Order -[hidden]right- Machine
  Machine -[hidden]right- Operation
  Operation -[hidden]right- Reporting
}

package "Replaceable integration ports" #F7FBFF {
  component "Catalog MachineAvailabilityClient\ncurrent: local/test stub" as CatalogPort
  component "Machine DeviceResultPort\nnot implemented" as DevicePort
  component "Operation MachineSlotClient\ncurrent: local/test stub" as OperationPort
  CatalogPort -[hidden]right- DevicePort
  DevicePort -[hidden]right- OperationPort
}

Client --> Gateway : public HTTP API
Provider --> Gateway : payment callback
Gateway --> Identity
Gateway --> Catalog
Gateway --> Order
Gateway --> Machine
Gateway --> Operation
Gateway --> Reporting

Order ..> Catalog : product/price snapshot
Order ..> Machine : slot snapshot + command
Order ..> Reporting : transaction sync
Reporting ..> Machine : machine/alert snapshots
Reporting ..> Operation : inventory/maintenance snapshots
Machine ..> Operation : optional critical-alert handoff

Catalog --> CatalogPort
Machine --> DevicePort
Operation --> OperationPort

note bottom of Identity
  Các service xác thực request bằng JWT và
  POST /internal/auth/introspect khi cần principal mới.
end note

note bottom of OperationPort
  Integration ports cố ý không quy định transport tương lai.
  Cross-service data chỉ là API snapshot hoặc logical ID; không có shared database.
end note

@enduml
